      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Hate that I'm always gonna have a side to me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That's still in awe when you're mad at me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You can't do it wrong in my eyes",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I hate it that you gotta break somethin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "To realize we're at rock bottom",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But kill me again 'cause the high's twice as high",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Wish this bullshit would end",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But we're back here again",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, I know we should break up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I just can't stay done with you, you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "When I take off my makeup",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Go to bed, wanna wake up with you, you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "We're best friends and enemies",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "We're good till you're dead to me, yeah",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I told you, \"Goodbye,\" like, hundred million times",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I know I sound so dumb",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
